# Consider: "Surveil 1. Draw a card." in that order, so a library of one card is surveilled before it is drawn (CR 701.46a).
# Bot1 puts the only card, Lightning Bolt, into the graveyard; the draw that follows is from an empty library, and the
# state-based action makes Bot1 lose the game (CR 704.5b) with Consider already resolved.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Consider
Island x5
Lightning Bolt

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Consider.Cast
Bot1.Arrange(| Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Graveyard = Consider; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Library.Count = 0
